<title>USA: Circon says USS Surgical suit has not merit.</title>
<headline>Circon says USS Surgical suit has not merit.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Circon Corp called U.S. Surgical's announcement of a lawsuit was without merit.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe this suit is without merit and we will vigorously defend ourselves. Our shareholder rights plan was adopted by our board in the course of exercising its fiduciary duty to shareholders,&quot; Richard Auhll, chairman, president, and chief executive officer of Circon said.</p>
</text>
